--TEST--
`static` in an attribute declaration's fields names the class the attribute is used on, so it compiles there, and the same field in a top-level `type` alias is `E0303` where the alias is declared
--FILE--
<?nvs
attribute Search on class, property { fields?: array<property<static>> }

type Fields = array<property<static>>;

#[Search]
class Post {
    #[Search]
    public string $title = "a";
}

Fields $fields = [];

echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0303]: `static` used outside any class
  --> case.nvs:4:30
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
